              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">The Commander has a hand weapon, full plate armour, lance, shield and warhorse. The warhorse may have full metal barding (+4). The Commander is a character but must lead and may not leave a unit of Knights. That unit is not Unreliable while the Commander remains alive.</characteristic>
